      "nets": ["Net-(U2-VCC)", "VCC"],
      "observed": "U2 pin 28 (VCC) is on net Net-(U2-VCC) together with only C24 pin 1; it is not on the VCC net.",
      "expected": "U2 pin 28 (VCC) should be connected to the VCC supply rail, as the specification identifies it as the digital-logic supply pin for the OLED display.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"22\") (name \"Net-(U2-VCC)\") (class \"Default\") (node (ref \"C24\") (pin \"1\") (pintype \"passive\")) (node (ref \"U2\") (pin \"28\") (pinfunction \"VCC\") (pintype \"power_in\")))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"24\") (name \"VCC\") ... (node (ref \"U2\") (pin \"6\") (pinfunction \"VBAT\") (pintype \"power_in\")) (node (ref \"U2\") (pin \"9\") (pinfunction \"VDD\") (pintype \"power_in\")) (node (ref \"U2\") (pin \"11\") (pinfunction \"BS1\") (pintype \"input\")) ...)"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "C7 (2.2 µF) — U4 VCC (digital-logic supply pin) to GND"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "U4's VBAT pin (its high-voltage supply input) is tied directly to the board's main VCC net"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The OLED display's logic supply is not powered, so the display will not function.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The design files contain an open connection: the OLED display's VCC pin (U2.28) is isolated on Net-(U2-VCC) with only a decoupling capacitor, instead of being tied to the VCC rail as required by the specification."
}

